🔮 Mellow Tarot

A web application for interactive tarot readings, built with Python and Django.

🚧 This project is currently under active development.

## Current features
- Have all 78 cards uploaded
- It has a page that randomly shows up a card on screen with it's meanings.

## Planned features
- Complete the Upright and Reversed meanings;
- Authentication and user login;
- Tarot diary, with previous readings;
- Other updates
